  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"10\" data-s=\"0\">10 g</span> kombu + 4–5 shiitake per litre is a standard starting point.</li><li>For a stronger dashi, add another shiitake or two.</li></ul>",
