  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wipe the kombu lightly with a damp cloth to remove grit.</li><li><b>Don’t wash it</b> — the white powder on the surface is flavour, not mould.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
