   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Into a jar, everything cold:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>kombu <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"10\">10 g</span></span></li><li>dried shiitake <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"4\" data-b=\"5\" data-n=\"3\">4–5</span> (about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"15\">15 g</span>)</span></li><li>water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"l\" data-a=\"1\">1 l</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Lid on, into the fridge for <b>8–24 hours</b>.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Soak overnight",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [],
    "illustration": "illustrations/shiitake-kombu-dashi/2.webp?v=1cd567b255",
    "photo": null,
    "result": null,
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": "Cold brew (overnight)",
   "part_id": "part-cold-brew-overnight",
   "time": "8–24 h",
   "time_html": "<span>8–24 h</span>",
   "title": "Soak overnight",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lift out the kombu and shiitake.</li><li>Squeeze the shiitake gently over the jar to keep their liquid, then pour the dashi through a fine sieve.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Strain",
