   "time_html": "<span>5 min</span>",
   "title": "Strain",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Trim off the tough stems and slice the caps — they’re the main ingredient in the <a href=\"napa-shiitake-egg-bowl.html\">napa cabbage &amp; shiitake egg bowl</a>.</li><li>The kombu can be brewed once more for a lighter dashi.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
