   "title": "Keep the shiitake",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Into a saucepan, everything cold:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>kombu <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"10\">10 g</span></span></li><li>dried shiitake <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"4\" data-b=\"5\" data-n=\"3\">4–5</span> (about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"15\">15 g</span>)</span></li><li>water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"l\" data-a=\"1\">1 l</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Soak for at least 30 minutes (longer is better).</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-5",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Quick version: soak 30 minutes",
    "diagram": null,
