   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat on low. When tiny bubbles appear at the edge (around <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"60\" data-b=\"70\" data-s=\"0\">60–70 °C</span>, ~10–15 minutes), take the kombu out — boiled kombu turns slimy and bitter.</li><li>Simmer the shiitake a few more minutes, then strain as in step 3.</li></ul>",
